  ],
  "translation": "Na olgeta kess we i kam long yu ol, i kam bilong ol brata bilong yu, ol i stap long ol taun bilong ol — namel long blut na blut, namel long Tora na komanment, long ol lo na long ol kot — yu ol mas warnim ⟨את⟩ ol, na ol i no ken rong long Yahwe, na strongpela bel i no ken kamap long yu ol na long ol brata bilong yu. Olsem yu ol wokim, na yu ol bai i no rong.",
